This timeline tests character events (join, update, leave) and various portrait setups/actions.
It will describe the desired effect, then do it.

label Positions
[i]Join a character with it's default portrait at position "left"
join TC3_BasicPortraits left

[i]Move the character to position "right", instantly.
update TC3_BasicPortraits right [move_time="0.0"]

[i]Move the character to position "center" in two seconds.
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="2.0"]
[wait time="2.0"]

[i]Change the characters portrait.
update TC3_BasicPortraits (happy)

[i]Mirror the characters portrait.
update TC3_BasicPortraits [mirrored="true"]

[i]Animate the character (bounce).
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Bounce" wait="true"]

[i]Animate the character very slowly (bounce).
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Bounce" length="3.0" wait="true"]

[i]Animate the character repeatedly (bounce).
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Bounce" wait="true" repeat="3"]

[i]Join a second character with an angry portrait at position "rightmost" (Slide From Right).
join TC4_BasicPortraits2 (angry) rightmost [animation="Slide From Right"]

[i]Join a third character at position "right" (bounce in, slow).
join TC5_BasicPortraits3 right [animation="Bounce In" length="2.0"]

[i]Updte the new character z_index.
update TC5_BasicPortraits3 [z_index="-1"]

[i]Leave the first character.
leave TC3_BasicPortraits

[i]Leave all characters (bounce out).
leave --All-- [animation="Bounce Out" wait="true"]

label In-Out Animations
[i]Testing all the built-in animations.
- Start
- Skip
	jump Movement

Fade In [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Fade In" wait="true"]
Fade Out [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Fade" wait="true"]

Fade In Up [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Fade In Up" wait="true"]
Fade Out Down [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Fade Out Down" wait="true"]

Fade In Down [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Fade In Down" wait="true"]
Fade Out Up [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Fade Out Up" wait="true"]

Instant In [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Instant In" wait="true"]
[wait time="0.5" hide_text="false"]
Instant Out [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Instant Out" wait="true"]

Slide In Up [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
Slide Out Down [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Slide Out Down" wait="true"]

Slide In Down [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Slide In Down" wait="true"]
Slide Out Up [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Slide Out Up" wait="true"]

Slide From Left [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
Slide To Left [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]

Slide From Right [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Slide From Right" wait="true"]
Slide To Right [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Slide To Right" wait="true"]

Zoom In [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Zoom In" wait="true"]
Zoom Out [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Zoom Out" wait="true"]

Zoom Center In [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Zoom Center In" wait="true"]
Zoom Center Out [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Zoom Center Out" wait="true"]

Bounce In [aa=0]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Bounce In" wait="true"]
Bounce Out [aa=0]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Bounce Out" wait="true"]

join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Instant" wait="true"]
Tada [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Tada" wait="true"]
Bounce [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Bounce" wait="true"]
Heartbeat [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Heartbeat" wait="true"]
ShakeX [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Shake X" wait="true"]
ShakeY [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Shake Y" wait="true"]

label Complex Animations 
join TC3_BasicPortraits center
[i]Test some animations with portrait movements and other updates.
ShakeX + movement. [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [animation="Shake X" repeat="3" length="2" wait="true" move_time="4"]
ShakeY + movement. [aa=0]
update TC3_BasicPortraits pos=x0.8 rot=20 [animation="Shake Y" repeat="3" length="2" wait="true"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0"]

[i]Test interrupting animations.
Shake interrupted by Heartbeat.
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Shake X" repeat="4" length="1"]
[wait time="2.5" hide_text="false"]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Heartbeat" length="2" wait="true" ]
Leave SlideToLeft interrupted by Join BounceUp
leave TC3_BasicPortraits [animation="Slide To Left" length="2"]
[wait time="1" hide_text="false"]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Bounce In"]
.
leave TC3_BasicPortraits 

label Movement
do UnitTest.set_container_debug_draw(true)

[i]Move a character around multiple times.
join TC3_BasicPortraits center
[i]Move it to the leftmost, instantly
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [move_time="0.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, this time over 2 seconds
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, 2 seconds, while fading the portrait
update TC3_BasicPortraits (plot) leftmost [fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="2.0" move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits (default) center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, 2 seconds, while the next text events changes the portrait
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="2.0" move_time="2.0"]
TC3_BasicPortraits (plot): I'm changing and moving!
update TC3_BasicPortraits (default) center [move_time="0.0"]

label Crazy Containers
do UnitTest.set_container_debug_draw(true)

[i]Change to a style with very strange portrait containers and attempt various different transforms.
leave --All--
[style name="unit_test_style_crazy_portraits"]
join TC3_BasicPortraits center [animation="Instant In"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost, which is set to FIT_STRETCH, instantly
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [move_time="0.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, this time over 2 seconds
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, 2 seconds, while fading the portrait
update TC3_BasicPortraits (plot) leftmost [fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="2.0" move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits (default) center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the leftmost again, 2 seconds, while the next text events changes the portrait
update TC3_BasicPortraits leftmost [fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="2.0" move_time="2.0"]
TC3_BasicPortraits (plot): I'm changing and moving!
update TC3_BasicPortraits (default) center [move_time="0.0"]


[i]Now move it to "left", which is set to KEEP, instantly
update TC3_BasicPortraits left [move_time="0.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the left again, this time over 2 seconds
update TC3_BasicPortraits left [move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[i]Move it to the left again, 2 seconds, while fading the portrait
update TC3_BasicPortraits (plot) left [fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="2.0" move_time="2.0"]
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
[wait_input]


[i]Now move it to "right", which is set to FIT STRETCH, but with the origin on the side
update TC3_BasicPortraits right
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]


[i]Now move it to "rightmost", which is set to FIT IGNORE SCALE, and mirrored
update TC3_BasicPortraits rightmost
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
do UnitTest.set_container_debug_draw(false)


label Manual Transforms

[i]Now let's test some manual transforms.
join TC3_BasicPortraits center
do UnitTest.set_container_debug_draw(true)
[i]Move the character to "pos=x0.1y1 size=x0.1y1"
update TC3_BasicPortraits pos=x0.1y1 size=x0.1y1
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]

[i]Move the character to "pos=x200pxy0.4 size=x0.3y0.2"
update TC3_BasicPortraits pos=x200pxy0.4 size=x0.3y0.2
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]

[i]Move the character to "pos=x500pxy0.8 size=x0.3y0.9 rot=45"
update TC3_BasicPortraits pos=x500pxy0.8 size=x0.3y0.9 rot=45
[wait_input]

[i]Move the character to "pos=x0.4 size=x0.3y0.9 rot=-10 mir=true mod=0"
update TC3_BasicPortraits pos=x0.4 size=x0.3y0.9 rot=-10 mir=true mod=0
[wait_input]

[i]Move the character to "rot=0 mir=false ori=x0.5y0.5 mod=3"
update TC3_BasicPortraits rot=0 mir=false ori=x0.5y0.5 mod=3
[wait_input]
update TC3_BasicPortraits center [move_time="0.0"]
leave TC3_BasicPortraits 

label SpeakerPortrait
[i]Change to a speaker portrait style and test that.
[style name="unit_test_style_speaker_portrait"]
TC3_BasicPortraits: I'm saying something and should be visible.
A general thought with noone saying it....
TC3_BasicPortraits (sad): I'm saying this with a sad portrait.
TC3_BasicPortraits (happy): I'm saying this with a happy portrait.
[i]TC4 Should have some dedicated portraits setup that the style will display in the speaker portrait.
TC4_BasicPortraits2 (Blink): I'm someone else.
join TC4_BasicPortraits2 (Plot) center
TC4_BasicPortraits2 (Surprise): This is the greatest thing ever!
leave --All-- 

label Z Index
[style]
[i]Test various z-index switches.
[i]Join multiple characters. They should overlap, with the newest one always being on top.
join TC3_BasicPortraits center
join TC4_BasicPortraits2 left
join TC5_BasicPortraits3 right
update TC4_BasicPortraits2 pos=x0.4
update TC5_BasicPortraits3 pos=x0.6
[i]Move the center character to z-index 10.
update TC3_BasicPortraits [z_index="10"]
update TC3_BasicPortraits [mirrored="true"]
update TC4_BasicPortraits2 [mirrored="true"]
[i]Try saving and loading and if z-index is preserved.
[i]Move the left character to z-index 11.
update TC4_BasicPortraits2 [z_index="11"]
[i]See if moving the left character makes them loose their z-index.
update TC4_BasicPortraits2 center
[i]Move the center character to z-index 0.
update TC3_BasicPortraits [z_index="0"]
[i]Move the right character to z-index 0.
update TC5_BasicPortraits3 [z_index="0"]
[i]Move the right character to position leftmost while changing the z-index to 20.
update TC5_BasicPortraits3 leftmost [z_index="20"]
leave --All-- 

label Multiple Parents
[i]Switch to a style that has Portrait Positions on multiple "layers".
[style name="unit_test_style_multi_portraits"]
join TC3_BasicPortraits right
[i]Move the character to left-over (should appear over the pink bar).
update TC3_BasicPortraits left-over [move_time="2"]
[i]Move the character to left (should be under the pink bar).
update TC3_BasicPortraits left
.

label Simple Highlight Portrait
leave --ALL--
join TC7_SimpleHighlightPortrait left
join TC8_SimpleHighlightPortrait2 right
TC7_SimpleHighlightPortrait: It's me, Antonio.
TC8_SimpleHighlightPortrait2: It's me, Eliana.
TC8_SimpleHighlightPortrait2: Me again.
An unrelated voice asks you to test if saving and loading preserves the highlight correctly.
TC7_SimpleHighlightPortrait: Hello friend.\
I do hope it all works out.


jump t0_overview/